     "text": [
      "Here are three app ideas you could build using OpenAI APIs:\n",
      "\n",
      "1. **Mood-Based Art Generator**:\n",
      "Create an app that uses OpenAI's text-to-image model to generate art based on a user's current mood. The app could ask the user to select a mood from a predefined list (e.g., happy, sad, anxious) and then generate an image that reflects that mood. The image could be displayed in a beautiful, high-quality format, and the user could even download it to use as a wallpaper or share with friends.\n",
      "\n",
      "To implement this app, you'd need to integrate OpenAI's text-to-image model, such as DALL-E or Stable Diffusion, into your app. You'd also need to add some UI to allow users to input their mood and view the generated image.\n",
      "\n",
      "2. **AI-Powered Language Learning Coach**:\n",
      "Develop an app that uses OpenAI's language model to provide personalized language learning guidance. The app could ask users to input a sentence or phrase they're trying to learn, and then use OpenAI's model to generate corrections, suggestions, and explanations. The app could also use OpenAI's conversational AI model to engage with users in a more interactive way, providing real-time feedback and encouragement.\n",
      "\n",
      "To build this app, you'd need to integrate OpenAI's language model, such as the Conversational AI model, into your app. You'd also need to add some UI to allow users to input text and view the generated feedback.\n",
      "\n",
      "3. **AI-Driven Journaling Companion**:\n",
      "Create an app that uses OpenAI's text-to-text model to help users generate and reflect on their journal entries. The app could ask users to input their current thoughts and feelings, and then use OpenAI's model to generate a suggested journal entry based on their input. The app could also use OpenAI's natural language processing capabilities to analyze the user's journal entries and provide insights and recommendations for improvement.\n",
      "\n",
      "To implement this app, you'd need to integrate OpenAI's text-to-text model, such as the ChatGPT model, into your app. You'd also need to add some UI to allow users to input their thoughts and view the generated journal entry.\n",
      "\n",
      "These are just a few ideas to get you started. The possibilities with OpenAI APIs are endless, and I'm sure you could come up with even more innovative and useful app ideas!\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "import ollama\n",
    "\n",
    "response = ollama.chat(model=\"llama3.2\",\n",
    "                       messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"give me 3 ideas for apps I could build with OpenAI APIs.\"}])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(response[\"message\"][\"content\"])"
